menu "BME690 logger"

    choice BME690_BOARD
        prompt "Hardware"
        default BME690_BOARD_DEVKITC
        help
            Which ESP32-S3 board the shuttle is connected to. Sets the pin
            map, the console port and the status LED.

        config BME690_BOARD_DEVKITC
            bool "ESP32-S3 DevKitC-1 with jumper wires (docs/wiring.md)"

        config BME690_BOARD_XIAO
            bool "Seeed XIAO ESP32-S3 / Sense on carrier Board B (board_b/)"
    endchoice

endmenu
